      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Barxadda gudaha iriddeeda xagga bari u sii jeeddaa waa inay lixda maalmood ee la shaqeeyo xidhnaataa, laakiinse maalinta sabtida waa inay furnaataa, oo maalinta bishu dhalatona waa inay furnaataa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo amiirku waa inuu ka soo galaa jidka balbalada oo iridda dibadda, oo waa inuu iridda tiirkeeda ag istaagaa, oo wadaaddadu waa inay qurbaankiisa la gubo iyo qurbaannadiisa nabaadiinada diyaariyaan, oo waa inuu iridda marinkeeda ku sujuudaa, oo markaas waa inuu dibadda u baxaa, laakiinse iridda tan iyo fiidkii waa inaan la xidhin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalmaha sabtida iyo maalmaha biluhu dhashaanba dadka dalka degganu waa inay albaabka iriddaas Rabbiga hortiisa ku sujuudaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qurbaanka la gubo oo uu amiirku maalmaha Sabtida ah Rabbiga u bixin doono waa inuu ahaadaa lix wan oo yaryar oo aan iin lahayn iyo wan weyn oo aan iin lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wan kasta oo weynba waa in lala bixiyaa qurbaanka hadhuudhka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Badarka",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " oo eefaah ah, oo wananka yaryar qurbaankooda hadhuudhkana nin waluba waa inuu intuu bixin karo bixiyaa, oo eefaah kastana hiin saliid ah waa inuu la bixiyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalinta bishu dhalatona waa in la bixiyaa dibi yar oo aan iin lahayn, iyo lix wan oo yaryar iyo wan weyn, oo waa inay kulligood wada ahaadaan kuwo aan iin lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dibi kasta waa inuu la diyaariyaa eefaah ah qurbaan hadhuudh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Badar",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " oo wan kastana waa inuu eefaah la diyaariyaa, oo wananka yaryarna waa inuu in alla intay gacantiisu karto la diyaariyaa, oo eefaah kastana waa inuu hiin saliid ah la bixiyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo amiirku markuu galo waa inuu jidka balbalada oo iriddaas ka soo galaa, oo haddana waa inuu isla iriddaas jidkeeda ka baxaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse dadka dalka degganu markay iidaha Rabbiga hortiisa yimaadaan, kii jidka iridda woqooyi ka soo galaa, waa inuu jidka iridda koonfureed ka baxaa, oo kii jidka iridda koonfureed ka soo galaana waa inuu jidka iridda woqooyi ka baxaa, oo waa inuusan jidkii iriddii uu ka soo galay dib ugu noqon, laakiinse waa inuu dhanka isaga ku toosan ka baxaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo amiirku waa inuu iyaga dhex galaa markay galaan, oo markii ay baxaanna waa inuu baxaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iidaha iyo maalmaha waaweyn ee la amray qurbaanka hadhuudhku",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Badarku,",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " waa inuu ahaadaa dibigiiba eefaah, iyo wankiiba eefaah, oo wananka yaryarna waa inuu la bixiyaa intuu bixin karo, oo eefaah kastana waa inuu hiin saliid ah la bixiyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba amiirku markuu diyaariyo qurbaan ikhtiyaar ah ha ahaatee qurbaan la gubo amase qurbaanno nabaadiino oo Rabbiga ikhtiyaar loo siiyo, waa in iridda xagga bari u sii jeedda loo furaa, oo isagana waa inuu qurbaankiisa la gubo iyo qurbaannadiisa nabaadiino u diyaariyaa siduu maalinta sabtida yeelo oo kale, oo markaas waa inuu baxaa, oo markuu baxo dabadeed waa in iridda la soo xidhaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo adigu waa inaad maalin kasta Rabbiga qurbaan la gubo ugu diyaarisaa wan gu jira oo aan iin lahayn oo waa inaad subax kasta kaas diyaarisaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kaas waa inaad subax kasta u diyaarisaa qurbaan hadhuudh ah eefaah lix meelood loo dhigay meesheed iyo hiin saliid ah oo saddex meelood loo dhigay meeshiis in burka wanaagsan lagu daro, oo kaasu waa qurbaan hadhuudh oo had iyo goorba joogta ah oo amar daa'imis ah Rabbiga u ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas subax kasta waa in qurbaan la gubo oo had iyo goor joogta ah loo diyaariyaa wanka, iyo qurbaanka hadhuudhka, iyo saliiddaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Amiirku hadduu wiilashiisa midkood hadiyad siiyo, taasu waa dhaxalkiisa, oo wiilashiisaa lahaan doona, oo waa hantidooda ay dhaxal ahaan u leeyihiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse hadduu dhaxalkiisa hadiyad ka siiyo addoommadiisa midkood, wuxuu iska yeelan doonaa ilaa sannadda xorriyadda oo dabadeedna waxay u noqon doontaa amiirkii, laakiinse dhaxalkiisa waxaa iska lahaan doona wiilashiisa oo qudha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba amiirku waa inuusan dadka dhaxalkooda wax uga qaadan si uu iyaga hantidooda uga bixiyo, laakiinse amiirkii waa inuu hantidiisa wiilashiisa ka dhaxalsiiyaa, si aan dadkaygu nin kastaba hantidiisa uga firdhin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu i dhex mariyey iriddii kadinka dhiniciisa ku tiil, oo wuxuu i geeyey qolladihii quduuska ahaa oo wadaaddada oo xagga woqooyi u sii jeeday, oo bal eeg, meel baa ku tiil dhankooda dambe ee galbeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu igu yidhi, Tanu waa meesha ay wadaaddadu qurbaanka xadgudubka iyo qurbaanka dembiga ku karin doonaan, oo ay qurbaanka hadhuudhka ku dubi doonaan, si ayan barxadda dibadda ugu bixin oo ayan dadka quduus uga dhigin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu ii soo bixiyey barxaddii dibadda, oo wuxuu ka dhigay inaan barxadda afarteedii rukun ku soo wareego, oo bal eeg, barxadda rukunkeed kastaba barxad baa ku tiil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo barxadda afarteeda rukunba waxaa ku yiil barxado kala xeraysan oo dhererkoodu afartan dhudhun yahay oo ballaadhkooduna soddon dhudhun yahay, oo afartaas barxadood ee rukummada ku tiil isku qiyaas bay ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hareerahooda oo dhanna waxaa laga dhisay meel safan oo afartoodaba way ku wareegsanaayeen, oo safafka ku wareegsanna waxaa laga hoos sameeyey meelo wax lagu kariyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu yidhi, Kuwanu waa meelaha wax lagu kariyo, oo ay midiidinnada daartu allabariga dadka ku karin doonaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
